{"steam_appid":3194360,"steam_name":"Formula Legends","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3194360/1182923444/6b647088be1f9ad297532c5028c4e716eed95eba/1766047456/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1766056767","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257206269/42371c71da898f59e54cd57bff77ddd4ebdda9b3/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1766056767","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194360/5512836c45ebe70ef1d3826b7b8c8dd4314ebad0/ss_5512836c45ebe70ef1d3826b7b8c8dd4314ebad0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785158997","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194360/0a38fe223f674a09339f3ec5df0ba977fc07a8a8/ss_0a38fe223f674a09339f3ec5df0ba977fc07a8a8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785158997","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194360/7a199e8befb728557ff1f4405940c9ad55485b2c/ss_7a199e8befb728557ff1f4405940c9ad55485b2c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785158997","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194360/42cbf102b7656d7b0f1c4a979f3973108e0770b1/ss_42cbf102b7656d7b0f1c4a979f3973108e0770b1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785158997","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194360/9aafcefaa1dd301a0e6729a448d8ed800cd082fe/ss_9aafcefaa1dd301a0e6729a448d8ed800cd082fe.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785158997"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194360/extras/f61a819a6ca4b55d1506b8056b10cf6a.avif?t=1785158997\" width=1560 height=406 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Formula Legends</i> takes you on a journey through the sport’s most iconic eras. From the roaring machines of the ‘60s to the cutting-edge technology of today, experience the evolution of open-wheel racing in a beautifully stylized world.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DRIVE THROUGH TIME</strong> - Slide into the cockpit of legendary cars spanning decades of motorsport history. 16 unique models inspired by creations from the 60's through to modern day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194360/extras/461c9b553ec7cf9e1ed651634523b948.poster.avif?t=1785158997\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194360/extras/461c9b553ec7cf9e1ed651634523b948.webm?t=1785158997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194360/extras/461c9b553ec7cf9e1ed651634523b948.mp4?t=1785158997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ICONIC CIRCUITS, REIMAGINED</strong> - Race across 14 circuits inspired by historic racing locations, each evolving through the years. From sun-soaked yacht docks to sweeping elevations, these tracks blend nostalgia with a fresh twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194360/extras/2f887b71e02a12032775f6767c6e067e.poster.avif?t=1785158997\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194360/extras/2f887b71e02a12032775f6767c6e067e.webm?t=1785158997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194360/extras/2f887b71e02a12032775f6767c6e067e.mp4?t=1785158997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MASTER THE ELEMENTS</strong> - Rain-soaked asphalt, strategic pit stops, and changing eras demand more than just speed. Fine-tune your racecraft, from battery management to slipstreaming, and chase the perfect lap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LEGENDS BEHIND THE WHEEL</strong> - Every era has its heroes. Fictional drivers, inspired by real-life icons, come with custom helmets and skill perks: tire whisperers, wet-weather masters, and pit-stop strategists. Their strengths might just be the key to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194360/extras/19e6dea5e67f87dfef8d0f1ab174dca0.poster.avif?t=1785158997\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194360/extras/19e6dea5e67f87dfef8d0f1ab174dca0.webm?t=1785158997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194360/extras/19e6dea5e67f87dfef8d0f1ab174dca0.mp4?t=1785158997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A JOURNEY THROUGH RACING HISTORY</strong> - Story Mode invites you to relive the defining moments of Formula racing. Compete in era-based championships, master legendary cars, and carve your name into history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194360/extras/dc68ce2471e812bb2dd251540821b32f.poster.avif?t=1785158997\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194360/extras/dc68ce2471e812bb2dd251540821b32f.webm?t=1785158997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194360/extras/dc68ce2471e812bb2dd251540821b32f.mp4?t=1785158997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE &amp; COMPETE</strong> - Create your own custom races and championships, climb the global leaderboards in Time Attack, and personalize your ride with modding support—from liveries to helmets and trackside sponsors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194360/extras/bc0b4abe847169c0684bb7350a0ea6b1.poster.avif?t=1785158997\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194360/extras/bc0b4abe847169c0684bb7350a0ea6b1.webm?t=1785158997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194360/extras/bc0b4abe847169c0684bb7350a0ea6b1.mp4?t=1785158997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 - 6600K AMD Ryzen 3 3100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 780 or AMD RX 480<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7 13th gen or AMD Ryzen 7 7800<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 2060 or AMD RX 5700<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Casual","Indie","Racing","Sports"],"developers":["3DClouds"],"publishers":["3DClouds"],"release_date":"18 Sep, 2025"}